Z||000001||GTDude||12-20-2001||08:10 PM||||LOL......nope dude.....it could be anything from the oxygen sensor to the map sensor to the fuel injection to the computer itself.  You gotta have it scanned or at least ground the passenger side 2 connectors behind the lighter bezel.  If you need more help...holler.<P>------------------<BR>GTDude's 86GT||||reg||1
